    {
        "text": "Stitch opens his eyes, and sees two familiar figures."
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya, I've got your fresh change of clothes here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, Croque, drink a little less in future, to be on the safe side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahahah, sorry, sorry. All's well that ends well, though, wouldn't you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I still don't see anything 'well' about this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the meantime, I suppose I'll find somewhere to change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "With that, the two of them notice Stitch has come to."
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Good morning, Stitch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still remember how you fainted?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was steering the boat, and then old Edge came running over, and then... oof, my head...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then the boat went out of control, crashed against the shore, and flung the two of you out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how about Master Edge?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "He woke up before you, and he's taken Elysium with him to survey for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, the gear on the boat!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_saw_n_2",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "text": "The equipment's all essentially wrecked. As for the survey gear... we had Deculture make that on the fly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cutting equipment won't be necessary, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_saw_n_2",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "delay": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "text": "You didn't notice the terribly loud noise ever since you woke up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Avdotya flashes a begrudging glance at a place too not far off."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_saw_n_2",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rockfall",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "And with her prompting, it finally hits Stitch that the persistent racket isn't just nature. Is that a mixture of a chainsaw's roar and collapsing rock?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
