    {
        "text": "Gavial, what in your right mind are you doing...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_saw_n_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 300,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -300,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks obvious to me. I'm sorting out this cliff face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The boat did put a considerable dent in the caved-in area, but clearing a passage was never going to be that simple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And with our cutting equipment down, I thought we'd be waiting for a while, but it turns out\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, seeing is believing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "HAHA! Forget rail repairs and surveys, any bozo can tell THIS is my strong suit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gazing all around, Stitch sees numerous fragments of extremely orderly cut rock, as well as a tunnel wide enough to fit two side by side."
    },
    {
        "text": "The fine work of Gavial, without a doubt."
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is to say, deprived of all the cutting equipment, Gavial opened a way through to the tunnel all by her singular self."
    },
    {
        "text": "Stitch can't help but begin to suspect that the rumors he heard from the Acahuallan tribes, all those legends of the invincible Gavial, were at least partly founded in reality."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_571_1#11$1",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_571_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
