    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "After having drilled through the cave-in, everyone enters the tunnel itself."
    },
    {
        "text": "The space inside is more of a cave than a tunnel in reality, both vast and profoundly deep."
    },
    {
        "text": "Nevertheless, Elysium is more than up to the task, and everyone proceeds through smoothly with him leading the way."
    },
    {
        "text": "So smoothly, in fact, that it piques their curiosities that he could grasp the tunnel's structure in such a short time; there's even suspicion he's been this way before."
    },
    {
        "text": "However, that idea, more a joke than anything, pales in comparison to the hesitance at the sight that greets them where Elysium comes to a halt."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a vein of Originium, exposed on the surface of the strata."
    },
    {
        "text": "Moreover, anyone with some knowledge of Originium could easily tell that this vein has been active for a very, very long time."
    },
    {
        "text": "And activity means\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Explosion."
    },
    {
        "text": "Or put less kindly\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Disaster."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can this be?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'd detected the presence of Originium veins in this direction back in the city's founding times, but they should've been much further out\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_571_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there any chance the earthquake pulled them here? I heard about a few small aftershocks in the wake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "text": "The suddenness of this vein definitely matches, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elysium"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not impossible...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, that's it! Chances are that earthquake shifted it right over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what's more, it gave it that push, got its activity slowly warming up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And because the dome's Originium sensor facilities have been down all this time, that's why we only just now found this out\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stitch, calm now. This isn't your fault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "We made this decision as the collective inhabitants of Zeruertza.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thing's just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "We haven't gone even a half kilometer from outside, I'd wager. If a full vein of active Originium explodes only that deep in...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then Zeruertza's out of luck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
