    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$radio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention all residents of Zeruertza, we interrupt this broadcast with an urgent notice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Following the conclusion of our swimming competition prior, Master Edge has taken the initiative in leading a selection of other contestants through the cave-in to survey the tunnel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "The results of this survey are not optimistic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Master Edge has discovered an Originium vein in the tunnel, located approximately one kilometer from the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "We tentatively speculate this Originium vein's existence was known at the time of Zeruertza's founding, in a stratum approximately three kilometers out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, tectonic shift originating in the earthquake half a year ago caused this vein to warp and extend closer to our city, and kickstarted its activation in the process.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Currently, Master Edge is leading experts to urgently evaluate this Originium vein's level of activity, and thus determine at what point in the future it will explode.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will provide further updates once accurate conclusions can be drawn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "As of now, we ask all residents to be prepared to evacuate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "people",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? An active Originium vein's going to explode? Where's this coming from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Judging by the broadcast, we never picked it up after the earthquake wrecked the dome, since the Originium sensor functions never got fixed since.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you mention, I'm pretty sure I've heard Master Edge make mention of the sort.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, nothing to do about it now, such as it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you... feel as though it was a poor decision to build 'The Great Aquapit?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What for? It's an outcome we're willing to take.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "True, that. We've never rejected any of the naysay from Master Edge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "text": "He warned as much when we decided to build this 'Great Aquapit' instead of repairing that hole in the dome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "text": "And we only made that decision once we understood and accepted the potential danger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "text": "All it is now is taking responsibility for the outcome of our choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So it is, surface-dweller. You don't need to give us any pity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think about it this way: we've spent a good long summer at least, haven't we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I completely agree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Though, evacuating, eh... Haven't decided what I'm going to leave behind. Have you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm nothing like you are. If you ask me right now, my house here's my most wanted and most satisfying design yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's fair. I hope that Originium vein's not going off too easily. I still need to think a little.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How about we go for a drink for now? Some Old Karl Mead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cool-Headed Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not my poison. I'll rather be having a No. 7 Whiskey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indolent Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd taken Durins to all be buffoons barely smarter than the Archosauria above them... It seems that was hardly the case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
