        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 200,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the outlook, Master Edge?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll need a little more time to be sure, but based on my experience\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll go off within a month.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A month?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we should lay the railway while we have the chance, and arrange to evacuate the residents through the tunnel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a chance. Not enough time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "Much more feasible if we dig a temporary shelter deeper in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're all aware the dome might be able to suppress some of the vein's explosive force, should it go off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the real issue is the Originium dust scattering afterwards!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Once it happens, that dust will fill this entire space, and all of us will be affected by it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to repair the railway despite any danger at this point, and then we clear any obstructions and have everyone take refuge in Ortzimuga!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But the tunnel's already wall to wall with Originium now! It'll be a nightmare to pass through safely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zeruertza's home to hundreds of thousands! Do you not understand how much time it'll take to feed them carefully through that tunnel? It's two by two at most in there, you realize that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey... cool the quibbling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, I'll get to you in a moment. Master Edge, do you honestly have a better plan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe we should begin immediately digging away from the Originium vein.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "text": "We dig a small-scale shelter, big enough to hold everyone, then we seal off the way to it. It's just a question of digging deep enough...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be a harrowing feat to construct a shelter for hundreds of thousands in this short a time, even with all the technology Zeruertza has.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And besides, that's hundreds of thousands of lives to support! What do you propose there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you think waltzing through the tunnel solves that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "At least there'll be leeway to begin to do so, provided we pass the most dangerous part of the vein!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if we stay in a temporary shelter, then consider what happens once the Originium seals off our singular passage to any other city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have nothing to look forward to but a drawn-out death!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, I can see your point there, but I still believe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I understand the risk in my argument! But it's the least worst option we have now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y'know... Avdotya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's not important, can you hold your peace for now, Gavial?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't really want to disturb you guys either, but\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$newhope02_intro",
        "key": "$newhope02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing as the tunnel's blocked...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our only option left is to fix that Super Convenient Lift-o-Matic #1 Tomimi mentioned, bring all the Durins to the surface and let 'em live with our tribes for a while, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, anything wrong with that idea? You guys have been arguing over this forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We head for the... surface?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, guys... did you never consider that before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
